WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Match the order and its state
Platform oversight is read-only. Match the order to its invoice, tenant
and vendor, then inspect payment and shipping states separately.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Read the purchase document
Match invoice identity, state and currency. Open the purchase for vendor
orders and item snapshots; a PDF that is not ready does not mean the
invoice is missing.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Read the recorded money state
Match the purchase, method, amount and recorded state. Awaiting
confirmation, pending approval and paid require different next steps; a
redirect is not payment proof.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Separate physical and financial work
Match the return to its order and current stage. Receipt, inspection,
restocking and financial refund are distinct decisions; use the next
permitted action.

